1
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:28,260
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:31,500
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,100
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,700
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:40,060
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:43,100
♪Calm but full of pearls♪

7
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:46,060
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:49,420
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,080
Hello.

10
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,760
This is Jing'an Care Center.

11
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:00,280
How can I help you?

12
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:03,360
I'm looking for a care home
for my grandma.

13
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:05,640
But she gets bored really easily.

14
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:08,080
Do you have any upcoming activities
for seniors?

15
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:08,680
Yes, we do.

16
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:10,480
Just last month, we held

17
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,720
a therapeutic music event.

18
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:13,960
It helps improve seniors' mental health.

19
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,600
After the show,

20
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:17,600
they all slept much better.

21
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:18,720
May I ask...

22
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:20,280
If you have a resident

23
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,880
named Tao Yalan?

24
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,360
Sorry, ma'am.

25
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:25,560
We can't share client info.

26
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:27,640
She's my grandma.

27
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,120
Here's my ID.

28
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,760
(PRC ID Card)
I'd like to visit her.

29
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,280
Members only here.

30
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,640
No entry without membership.

31
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:35,040
Do you have a membership?

32
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:37,240
How much? Sign me up.

33
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:41,800
Certainly, sir.

34
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:43,280
A 200,000 yuan deposit

35
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:45,080
gets you Diamond VIP status.

36
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:48,080
Can you tell me now?

37
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,640
Of course! This way, please.

38
00:01:52,460 --> 00:01:53,000
=Quite The Girl=

39
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:53,520
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

40
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:53,980
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

41
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:55,420
=Episode 24=

42
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:56,880
Sir, ma'am.

43
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,480
Let me show you around.

44
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,400
Our rooms are fully automated,

45
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,480
with climate control.

46
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,280
As you know,

47
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,160
we're the best care home in the city.

48
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:06,560
(It's like finding a needle
in a haystack.)

49
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,560
(Way too slow.)

50
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,480
So naturally,

51
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:09,760
we offer the best care.

52
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:11,720
Take a look at the room.

53
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:13,360
It's fully customizable.

54
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:13,960
The seniors...

55
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,040
Pretend to scold her.

56
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:17,200
Total trash.

57
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:18,360
I paid 200,000 yuan,

58
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,760
and this is what I get?

59
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:21,480
Are all your rooms facing north?

60
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:22,760
How are seniors supposed
to get enough calcium?

61
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,200
There's no sunlight at all.

62
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:25,760
Sorry...

63
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:28,000
I want you to take us right now,

64
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,160
to a south-facing room.

65
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,200
They're all occupied.

66
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,000
I can't show you.

67
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:38,000
Don't you know who he is?

68
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:40,240
He's Mr. Duan,
President of Dongchen Group.

69
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:41,680
He's often in the news.

70
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:42,880
Duan Xiuming.

71
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,280
Hello, Mr. Duan.

72
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:46,160
This is my wife, Lu Mingyu.

73
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:48,600
Dongchen Group expects the best room.

74
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,080
You have three days.

75
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,800
Get me a south-facing room.

76
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:52,840
If you can't,

77
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,560
you can kiss this business goodbye.

78
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:58,120
I'll shut you down within a week.

79
00:02:59,320 --> 00:02:59,920
I...

80
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:03,680
Hurry up.

81
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,680
Mr. Duan, I'll do my best.

82
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:25,400
Can I yell at you?

83
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,680
Go ahead.

84
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,520
You jerk, Lu Mingye.

85
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:34,760
What are you plotting this time?

86
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:37,760
The care home's strictly managed.

87
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,400
The fastest way

88
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,120
is to expose ourselves.

89
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,680
You sure this will work?

90
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:47,440
Lu Qiuliang keeps Grandma under watch.

91
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:49,120
He'll soon find out

92
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,680
we went to the care home.

93
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:53,680
All we have to do is wait patiently.

94
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:55,800
♪Rare pride♪

95
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,680
Zhan Xiang.

96
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:58,200
Keep an eye on Lu's butler.

97
00:03:58,640 --> 00:03:59,520
In the next few days,

98
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:00,960
he'll visit Jing'an Care Center.

99
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:02,560
Keep me posted.

100
00:04:04,180 --> 00:04:08,300
♪Drowning in you, no way to hide♪

101
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,200
Honey.

102
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,400
Am I doing a good job?

103
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,200
Not bad.

104
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:20,320
Do you like bad boys?

105
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,000
What do you mean?

106
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:28,180
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

107
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:31,040
You're always getting me into trouble.

108
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:33,760
Likewise.

109
00:04:34,180 --> 00:04:37,900
♪All my world's meant for you to keep♪

110
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,640
You know the bad thing I'm most glad

111
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:40,440
I did?

112
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:42,400
It's saying yes to you.

113
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:44,320
For sex.

114
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:46,960
Or who knows how many guys

115
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,200
would be trying to steal you.

116
00:04:49,660 --> 00:04:53,060
♪You own my mind, you own my soul♪

117
00:04:53,180 --> 00:04:54,220
♪I'm obsessed♪

118
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:55,260
♪Consumed♪

119
00:04:55,340 --> 00:04:56,860
♪Under your spell♪

120
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:58,420
♪My power bends for you♪

121
00:04:58,540 --> 00:05:00,860
♪No parallel♪

122
00:05:02,020 --> 00:05:04,660
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

123
00:05:05,940 --> 00:05:10,420
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

124
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:14,500
♪Stare at me, tell me you need me♪

125
00:05:14,580 --> 00:05:17,020
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

126
00:05:18,940 --> 00:05:21,340
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

127
00:05:22,820 --> 00:05:27,300
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

128
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:30,860
♪All my world's meant for you to keep♪

129
00:05:30,940 --> 00:05:34,980
♪Every piece, every breath for you deep♪

130
00:05:40,060 --> 00:05:41,860
♪For you deep♪

131
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,920
The care home said

132
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,960
a man named Duan Xiuming caused a scene.

133
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,480
And then?

134
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,800
But they didn't find her.

135
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:55,560
What else?

136
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:57,160
Duan Xiuming threatened

137
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:59,680
to shut the care home down.

138
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,480
Duan Xiuming

139
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,600
is still wet behind the ears.

140
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,040
Wants to take someone from me?

141
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,640
Not a chance.

142
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:10,600
Oh, right.

143
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,520
How are the papers
for my mom's trip abroad?

144
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,880
It's all done.

145
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,520
We've contacted a clinic overseas.

146
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,520
She can leave anytime.

147
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:18,880
Send her abroad soon.

148
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,960
Let's see where they look for her then.

149
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:21,680
Okay.

150
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:27,160
Speak.

151
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,800
Say that again?

152
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,800
Duan Xiuming took my mom?

153
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:35,240
Get to the care home. Stop them. Hurry.

154
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,600
Okay, I'm on it.

155
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:44,040
Ma'am.

156
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,360
Are you all right?

157
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,880
When's my granddaughter visiting?

158
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,080
Well...

159
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:50,960
Grandma!

160
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,680
I'm here.

161
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,520
Ye.

162
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:58,520
Take Grandma outside.

163
00:06:58,840 --> 00:06:59,920
Let me talk to him.

164
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:00,720
Okay.

165
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:06,000
I'm just following orders.

166
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,240
It's all the boss's idea.

167
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:08,440
Tell your boss

168
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:10,400
to keep his hands off my people.

169
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,520
Or he'll get hurt.

170
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,960
Duan Xiuming!

171
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,400
You'll never beat me!

172
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:41,760
Grandma.

173
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:44,840
The hospital paperwork's done.

174
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,400
You just rest here, okay?

175
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,240
Where's Duan Xiuming?

176
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,040
Some men came by

177
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,600
and took him away.

178
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:53,800
What?

179
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:58,720
Hello?

180
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,720
(Lu Mingye, come home and save me!)

181
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:02,640
Hurry, go!

182
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,080
Grandma, I gotta go.

183
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:08,240
Duan Xiuming.

184
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:23,920
(Sorry.)

185
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,040
(Lu Mingye.)

186
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,920
(You've suffered for so many years)

187
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,440
(without me.)

188
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,120
(I can't change)

189
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:32,960
(your past.)

190
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,560
(But in the future...)

191
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,040
(I'll keep you safe.)

192
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:38,200
(From now on, your happiness)

193
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,320
(is on me.)

194
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,520
Today's dose
of Lu Mingye happiness is...

195
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:48,480
Happy birthday.

196
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:51,400
Here's to leaving the past behind

197
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,840
and starting anew.

198
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:58,080
I'd love some cake today.

199
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:00,800
But it's not my real birthday.

200
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:02,760
That's cheating.

201
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,920
You still owe me today's happiness.

202
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,240
So, to make you happy,

203
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,240
let's play a little game.

204
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,520
Sure.

205
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:16,280
But you have to make me laugh.

206
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:20,280
Making my wife laugh? Easy.

207
00:09:22,820 --> 00:09:29,100
♪With you, no place is far♪

208
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,160
Listen to the rules.

209
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:33,760
We'll take turns asking questions.

210
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:36,440
Your answer must be the exact opposite

211
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,400
of what you really think.

212
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,320
Sure.

213
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:41,880
Unless you're too scared to play.

214
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:46,000
Alright.

215
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,040
I'll go first.

216
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,680
Use three words

217
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:53,600
to compliment me.

218
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:57,680
Ugly.

219
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,280
Boring.

220
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,280
Player.

221
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:06,800
♪Sharing one umbrella in the rain♪

222
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:09,960
If we could switch bodies for a day,

223
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,400
what would you do?

224
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:14,720
You're even naughtier than I thought.

225
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,760
If I switched bodies with you,

226
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:24,960
I'd spend all day with Duan Xiuming...

227
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,680
doing chores.

228
00:10:29,780 --> 00:10:34,960
♪With you by my side♪

229
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,160
Proof of happiness.

230
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:37,400
No backing out.

231
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:41,160
I won't go easy on you this time.

232
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:44,680
Good girl.

233
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,480
What kind of male models
do you usually order?

234
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,760
Disobedient ones.

235
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,280
Ones who can't drive.

236
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:55,280
Ones who can't get things done.

237
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,080
The guy...

238
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,680
Sounds oddly familiar.

239
00:10:58,880 --> 00:10:59,920
I'll order you next time.

240
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,240
Back then,

241
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,640
why did you say yes to sex?

242
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,480
You left me no choice.

243
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:15,940
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

244
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:17,280
Lu Mingye.

245
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,080
Do you love me?

246
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:27,400
I don't...

247
00:11:32,180 --> 00:11:36,240
♪A love letter written in song♪

248
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,320
No more games?

249
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,960
Does your heart never race?

250
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,320
Who taught you to control your emotions?

251
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:47,440
No one.

252
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:48,920
Self-taught.

253
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:51,560
Are you like this in love?

254
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,840
Love makes you emotional.

255
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,880
I don't like that.

256
00:11:58,240 --> 00:12:00,240
You really are one wild, untamable deer.

257
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,880
Then let me teach you how to love.

258
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:06,160
Every time I get serious, you laugh.

259
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:07,760
Why? Seriously.

260
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:09,160
You, teaching me how to love?

261
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:12,240
Aren't you the one
who always loses to me?

262
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:16,000
Nobody wins forever.

263
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:18,760
Who's to say I won't win the next round?

264
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,080
My turn to ask.

265
00:12:21,300 --> 00:12:26,140
♪Close your eyes and count♪

266
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:28,600
Do you love me?

267
00:12:44,640 --> 00:12:48,960
♪A love letter written in song♪

268
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:49,680
Fine.

269
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:52,880
A bet's a bet.

270
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:56,340
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

271
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,320
I can't say I don't love you.

272
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:04,780
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

273
00:13:05,260 --> 00:13:11,420
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

274
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:18,940
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

275
00:13:19,140 --> 00:13:26,020
♪I'll read every look on your face♪

276
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:33,100
♪Gemini's joy, a little magic for you♪

277
00:13:33,700 --> 00:13:38,620
♪Close your eyes and count♪

278
00:13:38,940 --> 00:13:43,580
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

279
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:21,950
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

280
00:14:23,870 --> 00:14:27,970
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

281
00:14:30,870 --> 00:14:35,650
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

282
00:14:36,590 --> 00:14:42,470
♪Chimes and cicadas
have been in love for so long♪

283
00:14:44,100 --> 00:14:50,100
♪A love letter written in song♪

284
00:14:50,930 --> 00:14:56,420
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

285
00:14:58,260 --> 00:15:04,570
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

